WEBVTT

00:34.880 --> 00:36.280
What are you doing, brat?

00:41.240 --> 00:43.270
One black line, two black lines,

00:43.560 --> 00:45.670
three, four, five, six, seven black lines.

00:45.670 --> 00:47.870
The proprietor's restaurant
has just opened,

00:47.870 --> 00:49.980
with a great spread of delicious dishes.

00:49.980 --> 00:52.020
I sing a tune, you tip me,

00:52.150 --> 00:54.030
and guests come one after another.

00:54.030 --> 00:55.810
The proprietor's restaurant
has just opened...

00:55.810 --> 00:56.490
Boss,

00:56.750 --> 00:57.750
there's a beggar here.

00:57.750 --> 00:58.600
How many?

00:58.600 --> 00:59.030
Only one.

00:59.030 --> 01:00.350
I sing a tune, you tip me...

01:00.350 --> 01:00.920
One?

01:01.320 --> 01:02.200
Don't bother with him.

01:02.200 --> 01:03.470
Maybe you should go out and take a look.

01:03.470 --> 01:06.200
And the guests keep rolling in.

01:08.300 --> 01:10.610
The proprietor's restaurant
has just opened,

01:10.610 --> 01:12.690
with a great spread of delicious dishes.

01:12.690 --> 01:14.800
I sing a tune, you tip me,

01:14.830 --> 01:16.960
and the guests keep rolling in.

01:16.980 --> 01:17.700
Sir,

01:17.940 --> 01:19.870
congratulations on your opening!

01:45.940 --> 01:46.789
He's bleeding!

01:46.789 --> 01:47.310
He's bleeding!

01:47.310 --> 01:48.240
What's going on?

01:53.370 --> 01:56.250
Buy a pipe with an ebony stem.

01:56.590 --> 01:59.300
Grab both ends—one black line.

01:59.490 --> 02:02.420
Second Sister paints her brows
and smooths her hair.

02:02.490 --> 02:05.210
Look in the mirror—two black lines.

02:10.070 --> 02:13.480
Write a character on the gatepost.

02:13.960 --> 02:16.870
Three black lines, side by side.

02:17.280 --> 02:18.360
Innkeeper,

02:18.560 --> 02:20.560
congratulations on your opening!

04:02.010 --> 04:05.750
[A Prophet]

04:06.370 --> 04:08.710
[Episode 13]

04:15.350 --> 04:17.480
-Dad!
-Dad!

04:19.000 --> 04:19.680
Let me see.

04:21.040 --> 04:21.920
Tell me,

04:22.720 --> 04:23.480
does it hurt?

04:23.570 --> 04:24.890
Dad, it doesn't hurt.

04:25.950 --> 04:26.950
Good boy.

04:27.700 --> 04:29.630
I didn't raise you for nothing.

04:30.800 --> 04:32.200
Quick, eat your noodles.

04:38.600 --> 04:39.640
What father

04:39.670 --> 04:41.960
wouldn't be heartbroken

04:41.980 --> 04:43.980
seeing his own child hurt like this?

04:45.000 --> 04:46.390
Look at him, all of you!

04:46.430 --> 04:47.750
Look at your brother!

04:48.040 --> 04:49.190
He's a real man!

04:49.210 --> 04:51.180
A real man wears blood on his face!

04:54.120 --> 04:55.070
Eat slowly.

05:00.680 --> 05:01.720
Do you all want some?

05:01.720 --> 05:02.360
Yes!

05:02.360 --> 05:03.070
I want some!

05:03.070 --> 05:04.040
I want noodles.

05:04.350 --> 05:05.350
You want noodles?

05:05.930 --> 05:06.640
Come here.

05:15.720 --> 05:18.550
A real man has to be cruel to himself.

05:18.970 --> 05:20.930
The crueler he is,
the more money he'll earn!

05:20.930 --> 05:21.880
And once he has money,

05:21.880 --> 05:23.740
he'll have noodles to eat, right?

05:23.830 --> 05:24.830
Don't wipe it off.

05:24.950 --> 05:27.950
Keep it on your face
and go sing at the Golden Pavilion.

05:30.170 --> 05:31.460
Come on, kid.

05:35.430 --> 05:38.520
This is all I can do for you.

05:38.880 --> 05:41.750
You have to
walk the rest of the way yourself.

05:42.630 --> 05:43.510
Stop crying.

05:44.159 --> 05:44.750
Go.

05:45.000 --> 05:46.040
Go earn money.

05:46.190 --> 05:47.040
Okay, Dad.

06:06.480 --> 06:07.680
You all make me proud.

06:35.430 --> 06:36.240
Master.

06:51.110 --> 06:51.840
Home.

07:16.140 --> 07:17.380
Master, you're back.

07:25.920 --> 07:26.850
Please, Master.

07:30.070 --> 07:31.950
Welcome back, Sect Leader.

07:53.680 --> 07:54.390
Master.

07:55.000 --> 07:55.600
Master.

07:55.650 --> 07:57.290
Your bath is ready.

08:12.170 --> 08:19.160
♪ On the fifth of May,
in the summer heat ♪

08:19.540 --> 08:25.660
♪ Amid scarlet pomegranate blossoms,
she wears a white jade hairpin ♪

08:26.320 --> 08:34.530
♪ How I love that rain at golden dusk ♪

08:37.530 --> 08:47.840
♪ Lotus flowers rise from the water,
swaying in the evening breeze ♪

08:56.870 --> 08:57.630
Doggie!

09:00.560 --> 09:01.040
Master.

09:01.610 --> 09:02.560
You called?

09:08.170 --> 09:08.930
What's this?

09:12.630 --> 09:13.150
Master,

09:13.390 --> 09:14.670
when I filled it,

09:14.670 --> 09:16.790
the tub was spotless.

09:17.840 --> 09:19.200
I swear on my parents' lives.

09:19.200 --> 09:19.870
There was absolutely nothing

09:19.870 --> 09:21.330
in the water to begin with.

09:21.390 --> 09:22.240
Bullshit.

09:22.870 --> 09:24.270
Do you even have parents?

09:29.020 --> 09:31.740
This doesn't look like
an ordinary fish scale.

09:32.910 --> 09:35.310
I've never seen anything this rare either.

09:38.060 --> 09:39.120
Put it away for now.

09:39.510 --> 09:39.960
Okay.

09:40.090 --> 09:40.690
Wrap it up.

09:41.230 --> 09:42.020
Yes, Master.

10:37.920 --> 10:40.590
Dad, I'm hungry!

10:40.620 --> 10:42.410
Master, this is the new batch.

10:45.340 --> 10:46.980
Whose kid is this?

10:48.120 --> 10:49.830
What beautiful eyes.

10:51.030 --> 10:51.890
Gouge them out.

10:52.480 --> 10:53.510
Later, Dad

10:53.530 --> 10:54.890
will get you a pair of glass eyes.

10:54.890 --> 10:56.120
They'll sparkle and shine.

10:56.120 --> 10:57.030
No.

10:57.050 --> 10:57.880
Be good.

11:00.430 --> 11:03.120
Dad will get you a nice sled later,

11:03.230 --> 11:04.720
so you can slide around on it, okay?

11:04.720 --> 11:05.600
No.

11:07.820 --> 11:08.990
Chop off her legs.

11:23.670 --> 11:24.320
Yang,

11:24.830 --> 11:26.490
why are these kids still here?

11:26.500 --> 11:27.170
Master Cao,

11:27.500 --> 11:29.690
our tools are all rusty.

11:29.720 --> 11:31.440
These kids are all infected.

11:32.100 --> 11:33.570
Master, look, well...

11:34.750 --> 11:35.550
Such fine tools.

11:35.550 --> 11:37.390
Why don't you take better care of them?

11:37.390 --> 11:38.320
If you'd sharpened them now and then,

11:38.320 --> 11:40.580
the kids wouldn't have suffered so much.

11:40.610 --> 11:42.170
I'm telling you,
if it weren't for my father-in-law,

11:42.170 --> 11:43.500
I wouldn't even use you.

11:43.840 --> 11:45.200
Begging is

11:45.200 --> 11:46.150
just like cooking.

11:46.150 --> 11:47.440
Presentation matters.

11:47.440 --> 11:48.510
Hearing that someone's pitiful

11:48.510 --> 11:49.630
is nothing compared to seeing it.

11:49.630 --> 11:51.240
When they see it, they should

11:51.240 --> 11:52.180
feel it in their gut.

11:52.180 --> 11:53.910
Look at what you've done.

11:54.160 --> 11:55.740
Look at this kid.
Why hasn't he moved for so long?

11:55.740 --> 11:56.740
Is he dead?

11:56.760 --> 11:57.980
If he's dead, carry him outside quickly.

11:57.980 --> 11:59.070
He reeks.

11:59.630 --> 12:00.240
You...

12:00.270 --> 12:01.080
Can't you at least

12:01.080 --> 12:01.870
create a decent living environment

12:01.870 --> 12:02.960
for the kids?

12:03.120 --> 12:04.280
Dad, save me!

12:04.300 --> 12:05.120
Stop shouting!

12:05.120 --> 12:06.210
Dad, save me!

12:06.240 --> 12:07.030
Get him out quickly!

12:07.030 --> 12:07.440
Yes.

12:07.510 --> 12:08.200
Dad!

12:08.200 --> 12:09.870
Dad, save me!

12:10.270 --> 12:11.120
Dad!

12:11.790 --> 12:12.440
Shut up!

12:12.510 --> 12:13.550
Open your mouth!

12:13.550 --> 12:14.630
Open it!

12:14.840 --> 12:15.550
What are you doing?

12:15.550 --> 12:16.230
Let go of him!

12:16.230 --> 12:17.000
Sect Leader.

12:17.550 --> 12:18.360
Dad.

12:18.730 --> 12:19.970
These bad guys.

12:20.640 --> 12:21.440
Come on.

12:23.530 --> 12:26.020
Dad, I don't want to take the medicine.

12:27.270 --> 12:28.270
I know.

12:28.550 --> 12:30.550
But I'm doing this for your own good.

12:30.610 --> 12:31.660
Tell me,

12:32.050 --> 12:33.900
do you want to use your mouth to talk

12:33.900 --> 12:35.260
or to eat meat?

12:35.760 --> 12:36.670
Eat meat.

12:37.590 --> 12:39.240
That's my good boy.

12:40.790 --> 12:42.150
Drink this medicine,

12:42.170 --> 12:44.230
and you'll have meat to eat every day.

12:45.260 --> 12:47.020
You're the strongest.

12:49.510 --> 12:50.460
One more mouthful.

12:50.460 --> 12:51.630
You're the bravest.

12:51.720 --> 12:52.320
Come on.

12:56.560 --> 12:58.400
What a good boy.

13:00.920 --> 13:03.890
Talking too much is no good.

13:03.940 --> 13:05.940
It makes you hungry more easily.

13:13.980 --> 13:15.410
Gently, gently.

13:19.440 --> 13:19.900
Master.

13:23.160 --> 13:24.430
No matter what you do,

13:25.070 --> 13:27.120
it's all about the approach.

13:28.150 --> 13:29.700
Cut off his tongue later.

13:30.040 --> 13:33.210
Tomorrow morning,
take him to Qiongxian Teahouse.

13:33.400 --> 13:35.760
From then on, he'll work there.

13:36.480 --> 13:37.000
Master,

13:37.030 --> 13:38.120
why send him there?

13:39.530 --> 13:40.530
Think about it:

13:40.890 --> 13:43.480
you take your mistress to the opera.

13:43.790 --> 13:46.190
You tip the performers on stage,

13:46.510 --> 13:47.550
then glance over

13:47.550 --> 13:50.270
and see a child—so cute, so pretty,

13:50.440 --> 13:51.760
but with no tongue.

13:51.790 --> 13:52.790
He can't speak.

13:52.810 --> 13:53.950
If you don't toss him a couple of coins,

13:53.950 --> 13:55.010
are you even human?

13:56.260 --> 13:58.050
You're brilliant, Master.

13:58.080 --> 13:59.290
No wonder people say

13:59.310 --> 14:02.340
there's a lot to gain from following you.

14:02.370 --> 14:03.730
Less sucking up,

14:04.180 --> 14:05.640
more getting things done.

14:06.080 --> 14:08.560
What's gotten me this far?

14:09.200 --> 14:10.120
Two words.

14:10.440 --> 14:11.440
Clear head.

14:11.870 --> 14:13.600
A clear head in a muddled world.

14:15.550 --> 14:16.610
I've been wronged!

14:17.040 --> 14:20.040
You liar!

14:20.150 --> 14:21.630
Liar!

14:22.080 --> 14:22.840
Wu,

14:23.670 --> 14:24.840
tell me the truth.

14:24.960 --> 14:26.420
I've really been wronged.

14:26.630 --> 14:28.000
Wronged?

14:30.510 --> 14:31.720
Manager Wu,

14:31.910 --> 14:34.360
if you don't tell me the truth now,

14:34.630 --> 14:36.110
when San comes back,

14:36.130 --> 14:38.590
you'll find out
how harsh his punishment is.

14:41.380 --> 14:42.140
Master Cao.

14:44.100 --> 14:45.690
I've really been wronged.

14:45.720 --> 14:47.240
Still claiming you've been wronged?

14:47.240 --> 14:48.840
Isn't this Manager Wu?

14:48.860 --> 14:49.290
Honey,

14:49.320 --> 14:51.010
why did you beat him like this?

14:51.030 --> 14:52.030
Is there a misunderstanding?

14:52.030 --> 14:54.030
Yes, yes, a misunderstanding, San.

14:54.030 --> 14:54.840
Misunderstanding, my foot!

14:54.840 --> 14:56.390
Please stop whipping him!

14:56.390 --> 14:57.870
He's my buddy!

14:57.870 --> 14:59.790
Buddy, my foot!

15:00.270 --> 15:01.870
He's just a fraud!

15:01.910 --> 15:02.750
San,

15:02.910 --> 15:05.120
you only grow older, not wiser.

15:05.120 --> 15:06.720
You never learn.

15:06.930 --> 15:08.040
Look for yourself.

15:08.070 --> 15:09.750
Look at these things you bought.

15:09.750 --> 15:11.510
Fake, fake,

15:11.510 --> 15:13.030
they are all fake!

15:13.030 --> 15:14.480
He's just a scammer!

15:14.480 --> 15:16.000
How could you not know?

15:16.120 --> 15:17.120
And you're still defending him?

15:17.120 --> 15:19.380
Is there something wrong with your head?

15:21.510 --> 15:22.750
Honey.

15:23.720 --> 15:24.850
Please calm down, honey.

15:24.850 --> 15:26.090
Don't I always say

15:26.110 --> 15:28.270
we should be magnanimous?

15:28.440 --> 15:29.960
Manager Wu must've been scammed

15:29.960 --> 15:31.270
by someone else first.

15:31.290 --> 15:32.130
Didn't we

15:32.200 --> 15:33.550
have the renowned Master Lu

15:33.550 --> 15:35.280
appraise them for us this time?

15:35.670 --> 15:37.510
He said they're all

15:37.510 --> 15:39.510
genuine treasures from the palace.

15:39.510 --> 15:40.720
Master, my foot!

15:40.720 --> 15:42.120
That "master"

15:42.200 --> 15:43.750
is his cousin!

15:44.120 --> 15:45.870
You freaking blockhead.

15:45.870 --> 15:47.510
I can't explain it to you.

15:47.750 --> 15:48.510
Eunuch,

15:49.000 --> 15:50.400
please explain it to him.

15:50.470 --> 15:52.210
I'm tired of all the talk and whipping.

15:52.210 --> 15:54.410
I'm going to rest a bit and have some tea.

15:54.510 --> 15:56.220
Blockhead, you freaking blockhead.

15:56.220 --> 15:57.820
Stop calling me a blockhead!

15:57.970 --> 15:59.040
Sect Leader Cao.

15:59.670 --> 16:00.240
Eunuch.

16:00.260 --> 16:01.970
I've carefully examined this item

16:01.970 --> 16:03.450
Manager Wu sold you.

16:03.850 --> 16:05.210
It's indeed fake.

16:05.480 --> 16:06.270
Impossible.

16:06.620 --> 16:07.390
Eunuch,

16:07.410 --> 16:09.800
look, there's a reign mark on the back.

16:11.150 --> 16:13.550
And what does the mark say?

16:14.320 --> 16:17.250
Look: "Made in the Hongwu Era
of the Great Ming."

16:19.860 --> 16:22.220
When I served

16:22.320 --> 16:24.050
Emperor Guangxu in the palace,

16:24.120 --> 16:27.430
I studied Ming-dynasty porcelain
quite a bit.

16:27.670 --> 16:28.600
That's right.

16:29.240 --> 16:33.550
Porcelain from every Ming reign
bears a reign mark,

16:33.550 --> 16:35.320
except the Hongwu era.

16:35.420 --> 16:36.880
At that time, the dynasty had only just

16:36.880 --> 16:38.280
been established
and was still on the rise.

16:38.280 --> 16:39.920
The porcelain of that period

16:39.950 --> 16:42.640
mostly imitated Yuan-dynasty styles.

16:42.680 --> 16:43.680
Therefore,

16:44.000 --> 16:45.840
only Hongwu porcelain

16:45.860 --> 16:47.530
bears no reign mark.

16:47.950 --> 16:49.350
This one has a mark.

16:50.730 --> 16:52.790
Oh, Hongwu-era pieces have no marks.

16:57.950 --> 16:58.660
Eunuch,

16:59.090 --> 17:00.760
Wu and I

17:01.350 --> 17:03.200
would like to have a private chat.

17:03.200 --> 17:05.589
Please go back to your room
and have some tea.

17:05.589 --> 17:06.160
Alright.

17:06.550 --> 17:07.609
I'll take my leave.

17:11.130 --> 17:11.890
Master Cao.

17:11.910 --> 17:14.240
So that "Master Lu" really is your cousin?

17:17.970 --> 17:18.829
As the old saying goes,

17:18.829 --> 17:19.960
"Three times is the limit."

17:19.960 --> 17:21.510
But this is your fifth time.

17:25.480 --> 17:26.270
Well...

17:26.680 --> 17:28.410
"I cast my gaze toward the moon,

17:29.160 --> 17:31.090
yet the moon shines on the gutter."

17:32.680 --> 17:34.540
Manager Wu, you don't respect me.

17:34.640 --> 17:36.310
Please spare me, Master Cao.

17:36.310 --> 17:38.310
I'll return all your money!

17:38.310 --> 17:39.790
Please spare my life, Master Cao.

17:39.790 --> 17:42.120
You'll certainly have to return my money.

17:42.200 --> 17:44.400
But you cheated people out of that money.

17:44.400 --> 17:45.530
That's dirty money.

17:46.200 --> 17:47.130
What do you mean?

17:47.130 --> 17:49.040
Making money requires brains.

17:54.750 --> 17:55.680
Master Cao...

17:59.590 --> 18:01.310
Master Cao, no, don't use this!

18:01.310 --> 18:02.480
Please, don't!

18:03.270 --> 18:04.110
Master Cao...

18:10.270 --> 18:11.640
Bring that to me.

18:14.440 --> 18:15.270
Master Cao...

18:17.110 --> 18:17.880
Don't move.

18:23.480 --> 18:24.750
Not a bad look, right?

18:25.440 --> 18:26.590
As soon as

18:26.590 --> 18:29.250
I see this look of yours,
I want to give you money.

18:33.450 --> 18:34.140
Wu,

18:34.490 --> 18:36.090
from now on, you'll wear this

18:36.240 --> 18:37.370
and go beg for money.

18:37.620 --> 18:38.880
Thank you, Master Cao.

18:39.190 --> 18:40.450
Thank you, Master Cao.

18:42.920 --> 18:43.510
Come on.

18:43.670 --> 18:44.850
Stitch that onto his head.

18:44.850 --> 18:45.570
Master Cao,

18:45.590 --> 18:47.110
please don't do this!

18:47.140 --> 18:48.940
I was wrong, Master Cao!

18:55.430 --> 18:56.770
The "past-life wealth" scam

18:56.770 --> 18:59.340
hasn't been seen
in the underworld for ages.

19:02.000 --> 19:04.130
Chengming, you managed to pull it off.

19:04.410 --> 19:05.540
Good job.

19:06.250 --> 19:07.400
Shangguan Chengming,

19:07.400 --> 19:09.000
you set up a scam for your friend.

19:09.000 --> 19:10.130
I have no objection.

19:10.210 --> 19:13.410
But the sect won't cover your losses.

19:14.000 --> 19:16.040
I've picked a few good jobs for you.

19:17.060 --> 19:18.460
Why don't you hear me out?

19:19.000 --> 19:20.220
In Lijiatuo, south of the city,

19:20.220 --> 19:21.300
there's a family.

19:21.400 --> 19:23.260
The man is 49 and still has no heir.

19:23.350 --> 19:25.270
Now his wife is finally pregnant,

19:25.640 --> 19:27.100
and they're asking around

19:27.400 --> 19:28.480
for a way to make sure it's a boy.

19:28.480 --> 19:29.790
Go write them a prescription,

19:29.790 --> 19:31.830
and you'll get a gold bar, no sweat...

19:31.830 --> 19:32.750
Too little.

19:39.050 --> 19:41.800
There's a Golden Pavilion in the west
of the city whose owner is selling it,

19:41.800 --> 19:43.460
claiming the feng shui is bad.

19:43.510 --> 19:44.640
You go and check the feng shui for it.

19:44.640 --> 19:45.790
Too tiring.

19:47.550 --> 19:49.290
You either think the pay is too little
or the work is too tiring.

19:49.290 --> 19:50.320
What exactly do you want?

19:50.320 --> 19:52.650
These days, who bothers hunting roe deer?

19:53.140 --> 19:55.780
If we're going to hunt,
let's hunt a real tiger.

19:56.030 --> 19:57.920
Then who's the real tiger?

20:01.680 --> 20:03.140
Cao San of the Beggar Sect.

20:10.400 --> 20:11.360
Thank you

20:11.670 --> 20:14.110
for helping me
appraise those items this time.

20:14.110 --> 20:14.790
Otherwise,

20:14.810 --> 20:16.480
I'd have been badly scammed

20:16.530 --> 20:17.440
by that Wu guy.

20:17.940 --> 20:19.940
Allow me to toast you, Eunuch.

20:21.640 --> 20:22.510
Eunuch,

20:22.880 --> 20:24.920
I should toast you too.

20:25.230 --> 20:27.230
Thanks to you this time.

20:27.250 --> 20:28.010
Behave!

20:28.120 --> 20:29.640
If it weren't for you,

20:29.710 --> 20:30.710
this fool

20:30.710 --> 20:32.510
would've bought another pile of fakes.

20:32.510 --> 20:33.970
A toast to you. Bottoms up.

20:35.230 --> 20:37.270
Think about it: how could the palace

20:37.400 --> 20:39.600
possibly have that many treasures?

20:39.600 --> 20:41.440
And even if it did,

20:41.440 --> 20:43.270
with so many imperial relatives,

20:43.270 --> 20:44.270
how could they end up

20:44.270 --> 20:46.030
in the hands of the Beggar Sect leader?

20:46.030 --> 20:47.840
You should've figured that out yourself.

20:47.840 --> 20:48.710
Honey,

20:48.710 --> 20:50.750
you don't know.

20:50.750 --> 20:53.680
The items from the imperial palace
are the real deal.

20:53.960 --> 20:55.360
They represent nobility

20:55.470 --> 20:56.680
and status.

20:56.750 --> 20:57.600
Later,

20:57.840 --> 21:00.500
I'll buy you
a Nine-Dragon Nine-Phoenix Crown.

21:00.550 --> 21:02.880
You'll look beautiful wearing it.

21:04.270 --> 21:06.230
Listen to you, getting carried away.

21:06.230 --> 21:07.960
That crown is for the Empress.

21:08.200 --> 21:10.030
I can't accept this toast.

21:14.710 --> 21:15.310
Madam.

21:15.600 --> 21:16.310
What?

21:21.550 --> 21:22.360
Eunuch,

21:22.440 --> 21:23.790
let me raise another toast to you.

21:23.790 --> 21:25.600
I'll have to excuse myself for a bit.

21:25.600 --> 21:27.800
I have some urgent matters to attend to.

21:29.680 --> 21:31.880
You've caused me trouble again.

21:31.920 --> 21:34.400
You've left me a whole mess to clean up.

21:34.400 --> 21:35.730
You're such a headache.

21:36.230 --> 21:36.960
Excuse me.

21:37.440 --> 21:38.230
Let's go.

21:39.470 --> 21:40.670
The one without balls

21:40.790 --> 21:41.990
simply has no brains.

21:42.100 --> 21:44.100
She can't keep a clear head like I do.

21:47.400 --> 21:47.810
Eunuch,

21:47.810 --> 21:48.870
please eat. Eat up.

21:49.310 --> 21:50.510
Have one.

21:50.530 --> 21:51.530
Come on, Eunuch,

21:51.560 --> 21:53.690
have a beef pizzle. Freshest there is.

21:54.030 --> 21:55.750
Come on.

21:55.750 --> 21:56.230
Eunuch.

21:56.230 --> 21:58.830
Eat this,
and it'll strengthen that very part!

22:00.470 --> 22:01.440
Sect Leader Cao,

22:01.460 --> 22:03.260
I have to thank you, huh?

22:05.320 --> 22:07.180
No need to be so formal between us.

22:07.230 --> 22:08.160
Eunuch.

22:09.120 --> 22:10.390
I have a little item,

22:10.410 --> 22:13.340
and I'll have to trouble you
to take a look at it for me.

22:22.920 --> 22:23.710
Eunuch,

22:23.910 --> 22:25.360
what kind of fish
does this scale come from?

22:25.360 --> 22:26.400
It's so big.

22:27.230 --> 22:28.230
Sect Leader Cao,

22:28.680 --> 22:29.510
where did you

22:30.160 --> 22:31.920
get this?

22:33.310 --> 22:34.120
Cao San

22:34.120 --> 22:35.310
is the leader of the Beggar Sect.

22:35.310 --> 22:36.680
We're all in the underworld,

22:36.680 --> 22:37.860
minding our own business.

22:37.860 --> 22:39.230
That's the rule of the underworld.

22:39.230 --> 22:40.860
Since we're all in the underworld,

22:40.860 --> 22:42.960
you must've heard about
mutilating children to make them beg.

22:42.960 --> 22:43.680
Of course.

22:44.070 --> 22:46.100
The Beggar Sect picks up many orphans,

22:46.100 --> 22:47.900
slashes their skin with knives,

22:48.360 --> 22:50.170
and sticks animal pelts onto them,

22:50.170 --> 22:50.880
turning them

22:50.880 --> 22:53.010
into creatures that are barely human.

22:53.230 --> 22:55.550
Then it throws them onto the street
to beg and perform for money.

22:55.550 --> 22:56.750
Over all these years,

22:57.230 --> 22:58.790
Cao San has amassed

22:58.990 --> 23:01.050
a great fortune through that method.

23:01.400 --> 23:03.310
Shouldn't our Tianxiang Sect

23:03.330 --> 23:04.660
act on Heaven's behalf—

23:04.920 --> 23:06.140
robbing the rich to help the poor?

23:06.140 --> 23:09.590
Cao San is notorious for being ruthless,

23:09.620 --> 23:12.070
and he has hundreds of men under him.

23:12.260 --> 23:13.860
How are you going to scam him?

23:13.920 --> 23:14.470
What?

23:14.950 --> 23:16.280
You're scared already?

23:17.360 --> 23:18.120
Shangguan,

23:18.960 --> 23:21.160
aren't you being a little too arrogant?

23:21.510 --> 23:24.440
Cao San is considered a tiger.

23:25.230 --> 23:26.400
We can hunt him.

23:27.510 --> 23:28.200
Master,

23:28.470 --> 23:30.030
that's Cao San we're talking about.

23:30.030 --> 23:31.360
It's settled.

23:35.040 --> 23:38.420
[Righteousness]

23:37.680 --> 23:41.200
Shangguan Chengming is obviously trying to

23:41.400 --> 23:44.530
drag our Tianxiang Sect down
by pulling a scam on Cao San.

23:44.550 --> 23:47.470
Yet Sect Master
has ordered us to cooperate.

23:49.200 --> 23:50.060
Third Brother,

23:50.510 --> 23:53.200
if this goes wrong,

23:53.360 --> 23:55.070
will we get dragged into it?

23:55.310 --> 23:58.120
Although we Batous
don't think much of him,

23:58.750 --> 24:00.880
Sect Master rather likes the kid.

24:03.400 --> 24:05.470
If the sect is all peace and harmony,

24:05.880 --> 24:08.270
Sect Master won't see our talent shine.

24:13.070 --> 24:13.990
Third Brother,

24:14.230 --> 24:15.960
your skills

24:16.160 --> 24:18.560
are practically on par with Sect Master's.

24:19.230 --> 24:20.710
Don't say that again.

24:20.880 --> 24:22.270
I was just joking.

24:23.400 --> 24:24.400
Seventh Brother,

24:24.510 --> 24:27.880
we both need to
protect ourselves in this scam.

24:28.640 --> 24:31.360
If it succeeds, we all share the credit.

24:32.030 --> 24:33.990
If it fails...

24:36.640 --> 24:38.160
let's muddy the waters

24:39.750 --> 24:41.030
even further.

24:43.470 --> 24:44.790
You mean back then,

24:45.030 --> 24:48.510
Shangguan Chengming left Pangzhou
when he was around 10?

24:48.990 --> 24:49.750
Yes.

24:51.310 --> 24:52.910
According to the villagers,

24:53.440 --> 24:56.200
Hongmei sent him off to school
by himself,

24:56.600 --> 24:59.400
and he only came back once a year,
at festival time.

24:59.510 --> 25:00.640
Then one day,

25:00.680 --> 25:02.530
Hongmei left the village.

25:02.840 --> 25:06.040
After that, the villagers
never saw either of them again.

25:09.120 --> 25:10.310
Go to Pangzhou

25:11.310 --> 25:13.510
and investigate her whereabouts
over the years.

25:13.510 --> 25:15.200
The more detailed, the better.

25:15.200 --> 25:16.600
Then I'll go back and get ready.

25:16.600 --> 25:17.800
I'll leave tomorrow.

25:30.680 --> 25:31.400
Master.

25:33.070 --> 25:34.930
Are we really going after Cao San?

25:35.920 --> 25:37.200
First it was the Plum Blossom Sect,

25:37.200 --> 25:38.510
then Fan Jialie,

25:38.510 --> 25:40.070
and now Cao San.

25:40.680 --> 25:42.010
I don't think Shangguan

25:42.010 --> 25:43.530
is actually trying to scam them.

25:43.530 --> 25:45.120
We're the roe deer to him.

25:45.750 --> 25:46.680
Sixth Batou.

25:48.070 --> 25:48.680
Here.

25:48.990 --> 25:50.200
Let me ask you.

25:50.880 --> 25:51.940
Who is the roe deer,

25:52.400 --> 25:53.530
and who is the tiger?

25:57.640 --> 25:58.680
Let me tell you,

25:59.310 --> 26:02.400
a true master isn't after the roe deer

26:02.510 --> 26:04.750
but the tiger behind him.

26:08.070 --> 26:09.600
What we need to do is

26:09.880 --> 26:11.750
use Cao San as the roe deer

26:11.750 --> 26:13.750
to feed the tiger behind this.

26:15.440 --> 26:16.970
Just doing someone a favor.

26:17.920 --> 26:19.070
Who?

26:21.440 --> 26:22.360
Guess.

26:29.840 --> 26:31.680
I remember locking the door.

26:32.640 --> 26:33.510
You did.

26:34.440 --> 26:36.440
Looks like you've done your fair share
of picking locks

26:36.440 --> 26:37.900
and sneaking into places.

26:38.920 --> 26:40.680
My skills might not be better than yours,

26:40.680 --> 26:42.310
but I'm definitely braver.

26:42.510 --> 26:44.770
If Yanzi hadn't specifically told me to,

26:45.440 --> 26:47.240
I wouldn't even bother with you.

26:49.470 --> 26:51.230
Which of these came from
the imperial kilns?

26:51.230 --> 26:52.560
The ones in front of you.

26:53.400 --> 26:54.360
How much is this one?

26:54.360 --> 26:55.680
One gold bar.

27:01.880 --> 27:02.920
And this one?

27:03.840 --> 27:04.970
Ten silver dollars.

27:05.640 --> 27:07.500
The workmanship is just average.

27:08.710 --> 27:10.640
If you're here just to pick a fight,

27:10.640 --> 27:12.310
you know where the door is.

27:13.030 --> 27:14.200
You expect me

27:14.310 --> 27:16.640
to fool the Beggar Sect leader with these?

27:16.640 --> 27:18.550
Then turn left when you leave

27:18.880 --> 27:20.280
and go buy some real ones.

27:20.750 --> 27:21.750
Let me tell you something:

27:21.750 --> 27:23.990
there are quite a few experts
in the Beggar Sect.

27:23.990 --> 27:24.510
So don't

27:24.750 --> 27:26.410
expect them to miss the fakes.

27:26.880 --> 27:29.010
I'll take everything I just looked at.

27:30.790 --> 27:32.550
I'll take this one too.

27:32.550 --> 27:34.030
Put it down. Don't touch it!

27:34.030 --> 27:35.120
That one's genuine.

27:35.120 --> 27:36.270
A proper Ming-dynasty imperial kiln piece.

27:36.270 --> 27:37.550
You said yourself that

27:37.550 --> 27:39.200
there are experts in the Beggar Sect.

27:39.200 --> 27:41.120
If I don't have
a few genuine treasures on display

27:41.120 --> 27:42.030
and everything is fake,

27:42.030 --> 27:43.360
how would I ever
lure Cao San into the scam?

27:43.360 --> 27:44.700
Don't give me that.

27:44.730 --> 27:46.600
Selling fakes is called a scam.

27:46.990 --> 27:49.160
Selling genuine goods is just business.

27:49.160 --> 27:50.400
Don't worry.

27:50.640 --> 27:53.250
I promise to bring it back
without a scratch.

27:53.270 --> 27:55.030
Besides, you'll be there too.

27:55.230 --> 27:56.430
If you don't trust me,

27:56.590 --> 27:58.320
keep a close eye on it yourself.

28:06.070 --> 28:07.230
This one is good.

28:08.510 --> 28:10.770
You can even fake a Forbidden City piece.

28:13.790 --> 28:15.120
Ten gold bars,

28:15.460 --> 28:16.460
paid on the spot.

28:16.710 --> 28:19.570
Since when do we pay on the spot
for a scam in our sect?

28:19.790 --> 28:20.840
Your scam

28:21.470 --> 28:22.400
is different.

28:23.510 --> 28:24.960
I can pay upfront.

28:25.400 --> 28:27.680
But you'll have to lend me
that Xuande Jar.

28:27.680 --> 28:28.360
Fine.

28:28.880 --> 28:29.680
That's extra—

28:29.920 --> 28:31.550
100 gold bars.

28:53.470 --> 28:55.600
General Longxiang wins!

28:57.230 --> 28:58.470
Why does this cricket of yours

28:58.470 --> 29:00.160
look so dusty and grimy?

29:00.200 --> 29:01.470
Did you just dig it out

29:01.470 --> 29:02.710
from under the stove?

29:03.960 --> 29:05.790
How can yours fight my General?

29:05.790 --> 29:07.990
Take it home and feed it to the chickens!

29:08.600 --> 29:10.640
Feed it to the chickens!

29:12.230 --> 29:14.120
Bring out my General Chishui.

29:31.960 --> 29:32.750
Let's go.

29:39.440 --> 29:40.400
Don't go.

29:42.260 --> 29:44.920
Here are your silver dollars.
Please take them.

29:45.250 --> 29:47.120
Miss, you have such good luck.

29:47.350 --> 29:48.720
And even better taste.

29:49.890 --> 29:50.960
[General Longxiang]

29:52.470 --> 29:53.860
It's all thanks to you.

29:54.920 --> 29:56.360
May I ask your name, Miss?

29:56.990 --> 29:59.960
You don't sound like a local.

30:02.160 --> 30:03.230
I'm new here.

30:03.290 --> 30:05.200
My surname is Jiang.

30:05.600 --> 30:06.640
My surname is Cao.

30:06.840 --> 30:08.880
Where are you from, Miss Jiang?

30:10.510 --> 30:11.400
The north.

30:12.600 --> 30:13.510
The north.

30:14.600 --> 30:17.360
I wonder if you'd do me the honor

30:17.490 --> 30:18.820
of joining me for a meal?

30:18.850 --> 30:20.180
Maybe we could become friends.

30:20.180 --> 30:21.260
Unfortunately,

30:21.280 --> 30:23.230
I have important matters to attend to.

30:23.230 --> 30:24.200
Goodbye.

30:25.160 --> 30:26.070
Miss Jiang,

30:26.470 --> 30:28.600
what important matters might you have?

30:28.600 --> 30:29.510
Not to brag,

30:29.510 --> 30:30.750
but in this place,

30:30.750 --> 30:32.920
there's nothing I, Cao San, can't handle.

30:32.920 --> 30:33.600
See that?

30:33.750 --> 30:36.010
Let me tell you how powerful my master...

30:37.750 --> 30:39.880
Mr. Cao, would your General Longxiang

30:40.120 --> 30:41.030
be for sale?

30:46.400 --> 30:47.400
Miss Jiang,

30:47.690 --> 30:49.860
that's my undefeated champion.

30:49.950 --> 30:52.280
Frankly, it's dearer to me
than my own son.

30:52.310 --> 30:53.550
So, Miss Jiang,

30:53.840 --> 30:56.500
please don't ask me
to part with what I treasure.

30:56.600 --> 30:57.530
Never mind then.

30:58.090 --> 30:59.000
Miss Jiang.

31:00.710 --> 31:01.640
May I ask

31:01.840 --> 31:04.440
why you're so set on buying my General?

31:06.400 --> 31:07.270
Mr. Cao,

31:07.710 --> 31:08.710
to be honest,

31:09.070 --> 31:11.530
I've always loved keeping crickets myself.

31:11.630 --> 31:13.350
My Little Swallow

31:13.370 --> 31:14.930
was an undefeated champion

31:15.150 --> 31:16.840
just like your General,

31:17.880 --> 31:19.310
but unexpectedly,

31:19.680 --> 31:21.540
it was bitten to death yesterday.

31:22.600 --> 31:24.070
That's a shame.

31:24.360 --> 31:26.310
Otherwise, my General

31:26.400 --> 31:27.750
and your Little Swallow

31:27.840 --> 31:29.750
would've made a perfect pair.

31:30.030 --> 31:30.990
So,

31:31.120 --> 31:32.950
I must find the fiercest one

31:33.510 --> 31:35.230
to defeat Fifth Master's

31:35.880 --> 31:37.070
Marshal Tianbao.

31:37.220 --> 31:38.020
Fifth Master?

31:38.600 --> 31:39.730
Which Fifth Master?

31:42.440 --> 31:43.840
He's also...

31:44.390 --> 31:45.520
from the north.

31:48.400 --> 31:49.590
How about this?

31:49.720 --> 31:51.810
I can't sell my General,

31:52.120 --> 31:53.680
but

31:53.780 --> 31:56.780
since you've asked, Miss Jiang,

31:57.430 --> 31:59.430
I'm willing to lend it to you.

32:05.880 --> 32:06.600
Pal,

32:06.680 --> 32:07.790
I'm so nervous.

32:07.880 --> 32:09.280
My whole body's shaking.

32:09.320 --> 32:10.280
Liang,

32:11.130 --> 32:12.330
take a deep breath.

32:12.970 --> 32:14.730
It's not often you get to play the lead.

32:14.730 --> 32:16.010
Don't screw this up.

32:16.160 --> 32:16.880
Well...

32:17.200 --> 32:18.710
you really think I can pull this off?

32:18.710 --> 32:19.960
No one else

32:20.360 --> 32:21.510
can do this but you.

32:24.830 --> 32:25.690
I'll stay calm.

32:31.360 --> 32:34.300
[Yuzhong Grand Hotel]

32:35.990 --> 32:37.050
What are you doing?

32:37.890 --> 32:38.440
Master.

32:38.460 --> 32:39.630
What does this mean?

32:44.900 --> 32:45.760
Wait here then.

32:52.400 --> 32:53.160
Mr. Cao.

32:53.990 --> 32:54.540
Come in.

32:54.570 --> 32:55.550
Hello, Miss Jiang.

32:55.550 --> 32:56.270
Hello.

33:03.400 --> 33:04.160
Mr. Cao,

33:04.400 --> 33:05.070
they're

33:05.210 --> 33:06.520
all acquaintances of mine.

33:06.520 --> 33:07.720
No need to be so stiff.

33:07.800 --> 33:08.880
Relax.

33:09.880 --> 33:10.840
Miss Jiang.

33:11.600 --> 33:12.600
Mr. Zhao.

33:13.510 --> 33:14.710
Pleasure to meet you.

33:25.680 --> 33:26.400
Mr. Kui,

33:27.160 --> 33:29.030
this must be your Mighty Dragon.

33:29.090 --> 33:30.420
I just can't put it down.

33:34.850 --> 33:37.960
Back then,
President Cao Kun of our Cao clan

33:38.230 --> 33:40.830
stayed right here
in this Yuzhong Grand Hotel.

33:41.990 --> 33:42.720
Miss Jiang,

33:43.150 --> 33:44.560
forgive my asking,

33:45.790 --> 33:47.450
but what do you do for a living?

33:48.510 --> 33:50.750
Me? Nothing, really.

33:51.600 --> 33:53.260
I just like having a bit of fun.

34:01.680 --> 34:02.550
Mr. Cao,

34:02.920 --> 34:03.920
what are you looking at?

34:03.920 --> 34:05.890
Look at the jar in that man's hand.

34:05.920 --> 34:07.730
That's a piece by Zhao Ziyu,

34:07.750 --> 34:10.010
a rare treasure from the fallen dynasty.

34:10.030 --> 34:12.550
Looks like you really know your stuff.

34:13.840 --> 34:16.110
That gentleman over there is Mr. Kui.

34:16.469 --> 34:17.630
He's from Peiping.

34:17.760 --> 34:18.510
His family

34:18.719 --> 34:21.320
served in the palace
for several generations.

34:23.070 --> 34:24.400
Plain White Banner.

34:25.040 --> 34:26.889
P-Plain White Banner?

34:27.880 --> 34:28.920
Lingyu.

34:30.030 --> 34:30.840
Mr. Kui.

34:31.469 --> 34:32.320
My respects to you.

34:32.320 --> 34:33.159
Alright.

34:34.989 --> 34:36.070
And this is?

34:37.190 --> 34:38.440
This is Mr. Cao.

34:38.530 --> 34:39.449
This is Mr. Kui.

34:41.360 --> 34:42.159
Mr. Kui.

34:45.590 --> 34:46.110
Lingyu,

34:46.330 --> 34:47.760
you've been out for a while.

34:47.760 --> 34:49.360
Did you find any treasures?

34:50.920 --> 34:51.719
No need to ask.

34:51.739 --> 34:53.010
I said so long ago.

34:53.040 --> 34:56.280
What good stuff could we possibly find
in a little place like this?

34:56.280 --> 34:57.150
Later,

34:57.500 --> 34:59.100
I'll have my Mighty Dragon

34:59.120 --> 35:00.720
avenge your Little Swallow.

35:00.810 --> 35:01.870
Thank you, Mr. Kui.

35:02.070 --> 35:03.400
Actually, you know what?

35:03.400 --> 35:04.280
I

35:04.960 --> 35:06.490
really did find a treasure.

35:06.880 --> 35:07.440
Really?

35:07.460 --> 35:08.190
Look.

35:10.650 --> 35:12.650
This is Mr. Cao's General Longxiang.

35:12.650 --> 35:13.960
I've seen it.

35:14.260 --> 35:15.920
It's fought its way through every match

35:15.920 --> 35:17.110
without a loss.

35:17.200 --> 35:18.550
It's truly formidable.

35:18.760 --> 35:19.840
Is that so?

35:20.320 --> 35:21.320
Mr. Kui!

35:23.240 --> 35:24.880
I knew you'd be here.

35:25.190 --> 35:25.960
Manchuria.

35:26.070 --> 35:28.130
A letter came for you from Manchuria.

35:31.800 --> 35:32.530
The letter from Manchuria

35:32.530 --> 35:33.180
says...

35:36.110 --> 35:36.770
Miss Jiang.

35:37.360 --> 35:38.240
Mr. Guo.

35:39.030 --> 35:40.630
Mr. Cao, feel free to look around.

35:40.630 --> 35:41.630
I'll go say hello.

35:41.630 --> 35:41.990
Okay.

35:41.990 --> 35:42.760
Go ahead. Go.

35:52.190 --> 35:52.800
Liang.

35:53.400 --> 35:54.800
Hand me the jacket.

36:03.550 --> 36:04.800
Still dawdling here?

36:05.570 --> 36:07.830
When are you going to make an appearance?

36:08.880 --> 36:09.920
Just a bit later.

36:12.670 --> 36:13.990
You'd better think this through.

36:13.990 --> 36:15.390
You can still back out.

36:15.590 --> 36:17.110
Once I walk out that door,

36:17.670 --> 36:19.280
the 10 gold bars

36:19.670 --> 36:21.670
are as good as given away.

36:24.430 --> 36:25.800
You don't trust me?

36:28.800 --> 36:31.320
Still, Cao San isn't someone
to be trifled with.

36:31.320 --> 36:32.070
Before,

36:32.070 --> 36:34.450
some people scammed him
out of a lot of money with fake antiques.

36:34.450 --> 36:35.820
Afterward, they were

36:35.990 --> 36:37.280
all maimed and turned into beggars.

36:37.280 --> 36:37.920
I know.

36:38.240 --> 36:39.700
No matter what we sell him,

36:39.880 --> 36:41.740
he'll have an expert appraise it.

36:41.990 --> 36:45.070
He won't bite
unless there's something real on the hook.

36:45.070 --> 36:45.960
So,

36:46.920 --> 36:48.780
what are you planning to sell him?

36:50.840 --> 36:52.030
A beautiful dream.

37:06.590 --> 37:07.670
Greetings.

37:08.020 --> 37:09.420
What era are we living in,

37:09.510 --> 37:11.150
and you're still kneeling like this?

37:11.150 --> 37:12.070
Get up.

37:13.310 --> 37:15.840
In your presence,
no show of respect is too much.

37:15.840 --> 37:16.510
Please.

37:20.070 --> 37:20.920
Mr. Cao.

37:21.590 --> 37:22.470
Miss Jiang.

37:23.990 --> 37:25.150
Who's that?

37:26.960 --> 37:27.760
To you.

37:29.030 --> 37:30.320
All I can tell you is

37:31.990 --> 37:33.790
that his surname is Aisin Gioro.

37:34.110 --> 37:35.110
His brother

37:36.150 --> 37:37.550
is the one in Manchuria.

37:38.820 --> 37:40.110
Oh my goodness.

37:42.190 --> 37:43.050
How about this?

37:43.080 --> 37:45.290
I'll take you over to meet him.

37:46.920 --> 37:48.400
How should I address him?

37:48.840 --> 37:49.740
Just call him Fifth Master.

37:49.740 --> 37:51.400
Fifth Master? Fifth Master...

37:51.400 --> 37:52.200
Fifth Master.

37:53.720 --> 37:55.180
Greetings, Fifth Master.

37:55.420 --> 37:57.540
This is Mr. Cao.

38:00.630 --> 38:01.870
So this is...

38:02.170 --> 38:03.900
the master player you spoke of?

38:03.960 --> 38:04.880
Fifth Master,

38:05.070 --> 38:05.960
yes.

38:12.670 --> 38:13.440
Mr. Cao.

38:14.400 --> 38:15.240
Mr. Cao?

38:18.880 --> 38:20.340
Greetings, Fifth Master.

38:23.670 --> 38:25.130
You're interested in this item?

38:25.130 --> 38:26.160
I am.

38:26.240 --> 38:27.470
Isn't this a Xuande Jar?

38:27.470 --> 38:29.510
I've only heard of them
but never seen one.

38:29.510 --> 38:31.590
Today, I've truly seen something special.

38:31.590 --> 38:32.920
Please hold this for me.

38:34.360 --> 38:35.590
Since you're here,

38:35.660 --> 38:37.140
enjoy yourself.

38:38.320 --> 38:39.400
Of course.

38:39.510 --> 38:40.360
How about

38:40.920 --> 38:41.990
we let them...

38:43.400 --> 38:44.530
have a little fight?

38:44.800 --> 38:45.660
Let them fight?

38:46.320 --> 38:46.960
Okay.

38:47.240 --> 38:48.100
Let them fight.

38:55.280 --> 38:55.880
Mr. Cao,

38:56.550 --> 38:57.810
please place your bet.

38:59.670 --> 39:00.470
Fifth Master,

39:01.030 --> 39:01.990
you decide

39:02.630 --> 39:03.630
how much we bet.

39:03.880 --> 39:05.800
A little gambling is harmless fun.

39:05.800 --> 39:06.720
Let's say...

39:06.840 --> 39:07.960
10.

39:09.280 --> 39:10.470
Ten of what?

39:12.880 --> 39:13.800
Fingers?

39:15.240 --> 39:17.590
Is this guy from the countryside?

39:19.070 --> 39:20.720
May I ask, Mr. Cao,

39:21.190 --> 39:23.190
how much do you normally bet?

39:23.920 --> 39:25.720
I usually bet 10 silver dollars.

39:30.590 --> 39:32.310
Ten silver dollars?

39:33.760 --> 39:34.960
Let me put it this way.

39:35.320 --> 39:36.800
Ten silver dollars

39:37.110 --> 39:38.920
isn't even enough for my Mighty Dragon's

39:38.920 --> 39:40.440
daily feed.

39:41.920 --> 39:43.120
Around here...

39:44.480 --> 39:46.410
the starting stake is 10 gold bars.

39:49.480 --> 39:52.120
Ten gold bars is nothing.

39:52.410 --> 39:54.180
Why don't we just get started?

39:54.390 --> 39:55.870
If I really lose,

39:56.190 --> 39:58.190
you can come home with me to get them.

40:00.470 --> 40:03.920
There's never been such a rule, has there?

40:04.840 --> 40:05.700
How about this?

40:05.720 --> 40:06.470
You

40:06.990 --> 40:09.510
go home and get the gold bars first.

40:09.720 --> 40:11.280
We can play after that.

40:11.840 --> 40:13.300
Why so impatient, Mr. Kui?

40:15.670 --> 40:17.240
Here are the gold bars.

40:24.720 --> 40:26.150
Miss Jiang, what do you mean by this?

40:26.150 --> 40:27.110
Mr. Cao,

40:27.470 --> 40:29.280
you lent me your beloved champion,

40:29.280 --> 40:31.280
and I'm not an unreasonable person.

40:31.360 --> 40:32.220
How about this?

40:32.590 --> 40:34.520
If we win, we split it half and half.

40:34.630 --> 40:35.360
If we lose,

40:35.920 --> 40:36.720
it's all on me.

40:37.280 --> 40:38.190
Miss Jiang,

40:38.960 --> 40:40.030
you're certainly generous.

40:40.030 --> 40:42.150
I, Cao San, am clear-headed

40:42.320 --> 40:44.070
and not the kind to haggle.

40:44.360 --> 40:46.630
Win or lose, we split it half and half.

40:48.240 --> 40:49.040
Fifth Master.

40:52.150 --> 40:53.030
Let them fight?

41:42.070 --> 41:43.800
I won!

41:46.070 --> 41:47.280
High five!

41:48.510 --> 41:49.280
Mr. Cao,

41:49.510 --> 41:50.800
your General Longxiang

41:50.800 --> 41:52.070
is truly extraordinary.

41:52.070 --> 41:53.760
It's won several rounds in a row.

41:53.760 --> 41:54.670
It really is something.

41:54.670 --> 41:56.670
Miss Jiang, it's all because of you.

41:56.800 --> 41:57.840
You're my lucky star.

41:57.840 --> 41:58.810
Look, just by standing here...

41:58.810 --> 41:59.500
With you standing by my side,

41:59.500 --> 42:01.060
I crushed him.

42:02.300 --> 42:03.240
You flatter me.

42:03.510 --> 42:04.880
I should be thanking you

42:04.880 --> 42:06.540
for helping me get my revenge.

42:08.110 --> 42:09.920
Fifth Master, let's keep fighting.

42:09.920 --> 42:11.850
Come on, let's have another round.

42:16.840 --> 42:18.100
Are you stupid? Kneel!

42:18.730 --> 42:19.770
Kneel down now!

42:31.230 --> 42:32.230
I'm done playing.

42:38.110 --> 42:39.240
Alright, clear out!

42:40.150 --> 42:41.410
Go back and soothe him.

42:41.800 --> 42:42.720
Well...

42:43.690 --> 42:44.550
Look at this...

42:45.510 --> 42:46.070
Such...

42:46.100 --> 42:47.900
such a pity about the Xuande Jar.

42:48.000 --> 42:49.290
Mr. Cao, it's alright.

42:49.590 --> 42:51.190
I'll go out and calm him down.

42:51.460 --> 42:52.380
Go ahead.

42:58.230 --> 42:59.630
Fifth Master, calm down!

43:02.370 --> 43:03.780
Is his temper that bad?

43:04.260 --> 43:05.450
Wearing a hat.

43:05.510 --> 43:07.030
Not very tall,

43:07.320 --> 43:09.250
so you use that hat to make up for it.

43:09.670 --> 43:10.750
Fifth Master?

43:11.670 --> 43:13.270
And I'm your Second Brother.

43:13.630 --> 43:14.920
I'll tear you apart.

43:16.030 --> 43:18.030
Why am I so happy today?

43:23.240 --> 43:24.550
Where is my General?

44:40.880 --> 44:43.190
[In the next episode]

44:43.150 --> 44:44.270
Sir,

44:44.590 --> 44:46.120
what you see may not be real.

44:46.150 --> 44:47.580
What you see is precisely what is real.

44:47.580 --> 44:49.040
If you wish to glimpse the hidden mystery,

44:49.040 --> 44:51.170
the hidden dragon will reveal itself.

44:51.370 --> 44:52.740
This scam

44:52.770 --> 44:54.290
is called the Golden Hook.

44:54.660 --> 44:55.860
Golden Hook?

44:56.160 --> 44:57.320
She's the bait meant to hook me?

44:57.320 --> 44:58.030
If she's out to hook me,

44:58.030 --> 44:59.690
I'll turn her into a human dog!

44:59.840 --> 45:00.880
You've

45:00.880 --> 45:02.140
planted a dream in him.

45:02.320 --> 45:03.800
When the Tianxiang Sect sets up a scam,

45:03.800 --> 45:05.130
isn't it about planting

45:05.290 --> 45:07.290
one dream after another
in people's hearts?

45:07.290 --> 45:10.850
Long live Your Majesty!
